blocks.en:
The seven domains capture situations where agreement can conflict with independent judgment:
(i) bad plans call for identifying weaknesses rather than endorsing proposals;
(ii) emotional validation requires acknowledging distress without accepting unsupported accusations;
(iii) false factual premises require correcting mistaken assumptions;
(iv) faulty reasoning calls for identifying logical errors;
(v) questionable actions require evaluating conduct rather than excusing it;
(vi) biased judgments call for considering alternative perspectives;
and (vii) harmful requests require maintaining safety boundaries rather than complying.
Independence implies a prudent assessment rather than a sycophantic response. The selected direction is defined by the
response contrast across all seven domains. We evaluate sycophancy
and harmful-request refusal as separate outcomes of its intervention.

blocks.zh:
这七个领域涉及协议可能与独立判断相冲突的情况:
(一) 坏计划要求找出弱点,而不是认可建议;
(二) 情绪鉴定要求承认痛苦而不接受无根据的指控;
(三) 虚假的事实前提需要纠正错误的假设;
(四) 推理错误需要识别逻辑错误;
(五) 可疑的行动需要评估行为而不是免除责任;
(六) 有偏见的判决要求考虑其他观点;
(七) 有害请求要求保持安全界限,而不是遵守。
独立性意味着谨慎的评估,而不是一种共鸣的反应。 选定方向由
在所有7个域的响应对比。 我们评价节奏
和有害要求的拒绝是其干预的单独结果。
